(7447734, 1178709, 30490, '<td valign="top">Oooh I like this.... Very nice!</td>', 'Oooh I like this.... Very nice!', '2016-04-04 01:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447760, 1178366, 68504, '<td valign="top">omg. fabulous.</td>', 'omg. fabulous.', '2016-04-04 02:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447762, 1178498, 68504, '<td valign="top">the unbearable biteless of being.</td>', 'the unbearable biteless of being.', '2016-04-04 02:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447764, 1178828, 68504, '<td valign="top">I know her. We studied classical Greek together and then Apollo struck.</td>', 'I know her. We studied classical Greek together and then Apollo struck.', '2016-04-04 02:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447766, 1178834, 68504, '<td valign="top">oh, to walk like a god.</td>', 'oh, to walk like a god.', '2016-04-04 02:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447834, 1178776, 30861, '<td valign="top">So where''s the flaw? Hell of a technical accomplishment. Is this the Sigma Sport?</td>', 'So where''s the flaw? Hell of a technical accomplishment. Is this the Sigma Sport?', '2016-04-04 12:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447835, 1178828, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, *I* think your flaw''s an asset; does that make it not-a-flaw? It''s a wonderful image but how do I score it? LOL.</td>', 'Well, *I* think your flaw''s an asset; does that make it not-a-flaw? It''s a wonderful image but how do I score it? LOL.', '2016-04-04 12:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447837, 1178363, 30861, '<td valign="top">Too good to be flawed, LOL. Barrel distortion doesn''t really "read" in this image, so it''s not a "flaw" in the usual sense of the thing. Fantastic smoothness and sharpness in the image itself. I''m guessing this is Richard Hahn''s work.</td>', 'Too good to be flawed, LOL. Barrel distortion doesn''t really "read" in this image, so it''s not a "flaw" in the usual sense of the thing. Fantastic smoothness and sharpness in the image itself. I''m guessing this is Richard Hahn''s work.', '2016-04-04 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447893, 1178828, 123833, '<td valign="top">you crazy diamond?</td>', 'you crazy diamond?', '2016-04-04 14:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447916, 1178740, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- I''m trying to comment 100%, and this is my first photo. This might make me change my mind and only comment on one, depending how it goes. :)<br/> <br/>I assume the flaw is the lens flare. First, I no longer think of flare as a flaw. But I look and see if it enhances the photo. I''m not quite sure on that. Part of me thinks it''s a distraction, but part of me thinks it leads nicely to the dog, brings out the fact that there''s some nice rays there that I may not have noticed, and moves the eye around. So it ends up balancing out the positive and the negatives of it, and so I''m voting on the photo -- 7</td>', 'Ok -- I''m trying to comment 100%, and this is my first photo. This might make me change my mind and only comment on one, depending how it goes. :) I assume the flaw is the lens flare. First, I no longer think of flare as a flaw. But I look and see if it enhances the photo. I''m not quite sure on that. Part of me thinks it''s a distraction, but part of me thinks it leads nicely to the dog, brings out the fact that there''s some nice rays there that I may not have noticed, and moves the eye around. So it ends up balancing out the positive and the negatives of it, and so I''m voting on the photo -- 7', '2016-04-04 15:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447924, 1178366, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- I think this is genius! Something that I don''t know if I would have liked as much without the challenge, but the eyes are so great, that I''m hoping I would have at least looked a little longer and not dismissed it. I would have loved it cropped down from the top just a small amount (the top of the diagonal line in the upper right). <br/> <br/>-10-</td>', 'Ok -- I think this is genius! Something that I don''t know if I would have liked as much without the challenge, but the eyes are so great, that I''m hoping I would have at least looked a little longer and not dismissed it. I would have loved it cropped down from the top just a small amount (the top of the diagonal line in the upper right).  -10-', '2016-04-04 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447928, 1178562, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to do with this one. Didn''t care for it the first or second time through the challenge, but the more I look, the more I like the colors. And the feel. Something doesn''t quite work with the main flower. But the rest has grown on me more. First voting pass: 6 for changing my mind.</td>', 'Not sure what to do with this one. Didn''t care for it the first or second time through the challenge, but the more I look, the more I like the colors. And the feel. Something doesn''t quite work with the main flower. But the rest has grown on me more. First voting pass: 6 for changing my mind.', '2016-04-04 15:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447929, 1178853, 100393, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2016-04-04 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447931, 1178338, 100393, '<td valign="top">Brilliant</td>', 'Brilliant', '2016-04-04 15:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447932, 1178656, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that I''m not sure what to do with. First glance is fascinating.  The top shape is incredible, and so is the second one down. I''m wanting it to be brightened up a little, perhaps just upping the contrast? Just thinking out loud, because it really calls to me, yet something seems not quite right. 7 for the initial interest. Not 8 because it doesn''t hold up as long. Will come back later to take another look.</td>', 'Another one that I''m not sure what to do with. First glance is fascinating.  The top shape is incredible, and so is the second one down. I''m wanting it to be brightened up a little, perhaps just upping the contrast? Just thinking out loud, because it really calls to me, yet something seems not quite right. 7 for the initial interest. Not 8 because it doesn''t hold up as long. Will come back later to take another look.', '2016-04-04 15:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7447934, 1178654, 103142, '<td valign="top">Drat. I''m just not finding a flaw on this one. I assume the underexposure? But that is brilliant. Centered? That works. Looking away from camera? I love those types of shots. This just is very effective. Thinking a 7 because it just doesn''t seem like there''s a flaw. But since this is the first time thinking through how in the heck to vote on this one, may come back and bump it.</td>', 'Drat. I''m just not finding a flaw on this one. I assume the underexposure? But that is brilliant. Centered? That works. Looking away from camera? I love those types of shots. This just is very effective. Thinking a 7 because it just doesn''t seem like there''s a flaw. But since this is the first time thinking through how in the heck to vote on this one, may come back and bump it.', '2016-04-04 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
