(7449130, 1178402, 30982, '<td valign="top">Flaw... hmmm..  Perhaps the two closest to the camera, but really, they frame the shotnicely.  Maybe that the plaids don''t match on his shirt...  I kinda like the shot just the way it is.</td>', 'Flaw... hmmm..  Perhaps the two closest to the camera, but really, they frame the shotnicely.  Maybe that the plaids don''t match on his shirt...  I kinda like the shot just the way it is.', '2016-04-08 22:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7449131, 1178855, 30982, '<td valign="top">I guess the flaw would be a bit of a burnt highlight?  Since I tend to have a lot of those (burnt highlights, or whatever the term is for wickedly overexposed) I don''t usually see it as a flaw so much as a feature.  An interesting sort of abstractish bit here.</td>', 'I guess the flaw would be a bit of a burnt highlight?  Since I tend to have a lot of those (burnt highlights, or whatever the term is for wickedly overexposed) I don''t usually see it as a flaw so much as a feature.  An interesting sort of abstractish bit here.', '2016-04-08 22:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7449132, 1178410, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  He seems to like her, too.  I suppose the flaw is the guy blocking half the frame, but in a way it creates a nice bit of isolation for your subject.</td>', 'Sweet!  He seems to like her, too.  I suppose the flaw is the guy blocking half the frame, but in a way it creates a nice bit of isolation for your subject.', '2016-04-08 22:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
