(7449136, 1178772, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the flaw is - perhaps the seaweed in his mouth?  A wee bit of burned highlights on the back?  Perhaps the duck leaving the frame instead of entering - though I tend to prefer those kind of shots myself.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the flaw is - perhaps the seaweed in his mouth?  A wee bit of burned highlights on the back?  Perhaps the duck leaving the frame instead of entering - though I tend to prefer those kind of shots myself.', '2016-04-08 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
