(7449146, 1178485, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice everyday scene - wishful thinking of spring with the tender new plants yet still wearing those heavy jackets.  Is the flaw the brightness?  The guy on the right?  I kinda like the guy there, though - nice framing.</td>', 'A nice everyday scene - wishful thinking of spring with the tender new plants yet still wearing those heavy jackets.  Is the flaw the brightness?  The guy on the right?  I kinda like the guy there, though - nice framing.', '2016-04-08 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
