(7449232, 1178773, 136989, '<td valign="top">Just returned from a long weekend trip where a number of these little guys kept us entertained at meals.  This is perfect imperfection! You''ve got the thieves casing the prize up close and personal and the reflection of the second will help identify him later when the authorities digitally enhance the picture. My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Just returned from a long weekend trip where a number of these little guys kept us entertained at meals.  This is perfect imperfection! You''ve got the thieves casing the prize up close and personal and the reflection of the second will help identify him later when the authorities digitally enhance the picture. My favorite in this challenge.', '2016-04-09 13:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
