(7449360, 1178708, 103142, '<td valign="top">Many definitely think blurry is a flaw. So then I''m trying to figure out if the flaw helps or hurts the photo. I think in the long run it helps this one. The feet are quite fascinating, the flowing behind her is great. The flow at the top is distracting. Would it be more interesting with part of the top cropped off? <br/> <br/>I think this would have been less interesting without the flaw. I think you''ve made the shot more interesting. Overall 7.</td>', 'Many definitely think blurry is a flaw. So then I''m trying to figure out if the flaw helps or hurts the photo. I think in the long run it helps this one. The feet are quite fascinating, the flowing behind her is great. The flow at the top is distracting. Would it be more interesting with part of the top cropped off?  I think this would have been less interesting without the flaw. I think you''ve made the shot more interesting. Overall 7.', '2016-04-10 14:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
