(7450965, 1178881, 150277, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>Your image definitely meets the challenge (except for the part about naming your challenge, but I certainly don''t think that''s significant since the intended ''flaw'' was quite clear.)  And I loved the ghosting.  I think it added a lot to this image, it made me think of Niagara Falls with all of the visible splash and humidity in the air.  And technically, quite a complicated image.  I like how you used multiple exposures to accentuate the lighting in the scene.<br/> <br/>I didn''t fine myself loving the image as a whole though with all the darkness mid-photo.  I can picture this scene with my mind''s eye and I bet it was spectacular, but all the darkness detracted a little from being able to enjoy the full scene in this image.<br/> <br/>But an above average score and a nice finish.  Well done.<br/> <br/>Shoot on!<br/>Julee<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club. Your image definitely meets the challenge (except for the part about naming your challenge, but I certainly don''t think that''s significant since the intended ''flaw'' was quite clear.)  And I loved the ghosting.  I think it added a lot to this image, it made me think of Niagara Falls with all of the visible splash and humidity in the air.  And technically, quite a complicated image.  I like how you used multiple exposures to accentuate the lighting in the scene. I didn''t fine myself loving the image as a whole though with all the darkness mid-photo.  I can picture this scene with my mind''s eye and I bet it was spectacular, but all the darkness detracted a little from being able to enjoy the full scene in this image. But an above average score and a nice finish.  Well done. Shoot on!Julee ', '2016-04-18 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7451041, 1178338, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is great. I love the action feel to it and I would have given this a 9 or 10.</td>', 'This is great. I love the action feel to it and I would have given this a 9 or 10.', '2016-04-19 16:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
